parent 2a4qq2
author ai
file src/gui/graph.rs
symbol build_scene
lines 12 105
hash b62b5f767f0090e5
note One node: the border says what it is (red when the step is stale, accent when focused, green on the path, plain off it), the header runs and buttons from header, then one hit rectangle per shown line. Buttons are right-aligned in the header. A node's hits are recorded body, header, lines, buttons, and the later one wins, so a button beats the header under it. A line is tinted when an edge leaves it: it names any node on the canvas the symbol calls, or one of its child steps, however either was revealed, so an off-path caller shows the line that calls the node it hangs off.

